  "sharing_info": "",
  "success_stories": "The Reedley Police Department, with the assistance of our local FLOCK LPR System, were able to quickly identify a vehicle within an hour that was involved in a fatal hit & run collision, that claimed the lives of two elderly pedestrians. Without the data provided from our License Plate Reader cameras (LPRs), it would have taken much longer to identify the vehicle involved. As a result of the vehicle identification, Investigators were able to make an arrest in this case within 3 days, for charges of Hit & Run Causing Death, and Felony Manslaughter.\nIn the California News\nOAKLAND, CA\n6/24/2026\n\nHOMICIDE / MURDER\n\nFlock LPR Aids Oakland Homicide Investigation After Daylight Shooting\nLPR\nRead full story\nSIMI VALLEY, CA\n6/21/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Helps Recover Stolen Vehicle Same Day in Simi Valley\nLPR\nRead full story\nROHNERT PARK, CA\n6/15/2026\n\nSTOLEN VEHICLE RECOVERY\n\nFlock LPR Alert Leads to Stolen Jeep Recovery and Two Arrests in Rohnert Park\nLPR\nRead full story\nSALINAS, CA\n6/11/2026\n\nBURGLARY / BREAKING & ENTERING\n\nFlock LPR Helps Identify Suspect in $50K+ Copper Wire Theft in Monterey County\nLPR\nRead full story\nBISHOP, CA\n6/10/2026\n\nKIDNAPPING / ABDUCTION\n\nFlock Safety Camera Aids Kidnapping Investigation in Bishop, CA\nVIDEO\nRead full story\nData & Usage Summary",
